## 6. RESTRICTIONS & COMPATIBILITY:
restrictions:
  max_io_current: "10mA"
  total_current_limit: "2000mA"
  warnings[9]:
    - "easyE4 has NO USB interface — programming is done exclusively via Ethernet (easySoft 7 online) or Micro SD card; never attempt USB connection"
    - "Relay outputs Q1..Q4 are NOT short-circuit protected — external fuse protection is mandatory; inductive loads require freewheeling diode or RC snubber"
    - "Analog inputs I1..I4 (0-10V, 12-bit) share the same terminals as digital inputs — configure each channel as DI or AI in easySoft 7; do NOT apply >10V to analog-configured inputs"
    - "Input I1 doubles as DCF77 time synchronization input — connect DCF77 receiver here; when used for DCF77, I1 cannot be used as process input simultaneously"
    - "Micro SD card must NOT be removed during program execution or data logging — always stop the program or de-energize before removing; SD slot is for programming and data logging only, not real-time I/O"
    - "easyNet cluster communication (NET): only base units with Ethernet can be NET masters; max 8 devices per cluster via Ethernet switch; do NOT use cross-cable for NET clusters with >2 devices"
    - "The EASY-E4-UC-12RC1 has 4 relay outputs max — for transistor (solid-state) outputs use EASY-E4-DC-12TC1; relay outputs have max 8A but switching frequency must not exceed mechanical relay life (10M cycles)"
    - "easySoft 7 license (EASYSOFT-SWLIC, 197226) is SOLD SEPARATELY — the device includes only the firmware; starter box EASY-BOX-E4-UC1 bundles the license + patch cable"
    - "Expansion modules connect via proprietary side plug (EASY-E4-CONNECT1) — standard DIN rail does not mechanically link them; the connector transfers both power and easyNet communication to expansions"
compatibility:
  sw: "easySoft 7 (EASYSOFT-SWLIC)"
  languages: "LD;FBD;ST;EDP (IEC 61131-3 subset)"
  protocols: "Modbus-TCP;easyNet-NET;HTTP-web-server;SMTP;DCF77"
  expansions: "EASY-E4-UC-8RE1;EASY-E4-UC-16RE1;EASY-E4-DC-8TE1;EASY-E4-DC-16TE1;EASY-E4-DC-6AE1;EASY-E4-DC-4PE1;EASY-E4-AC-8RE1;EASY-E4-AC-16RE1"
  certifications: "CE;cULus-UL61010;CSA-C22.2-61010;IEC-61131-2;EN-61000-6-2;EN-61000-6-3;IP20"
  hmi: "XV-102-A0-35TQRB-1E4 (3.5in touch panel);XV300 (via Modbus TCP)"

